WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:13.937
Brad: Armor! Oh great!

2
00:00:13.938 --> 00:00:16.513
How are we going to defeat that?

3
00:00:16.514 --> 00:00:22.851
Danny: Just watch this!

4
00:00:22.852 --> 00:00:27.220
Tina: Uh, I’m still watching.

5
00:00:27.221 --> 00:00:28.398
Brad: Wait a minute.

6
00:00:28.399 --> 00:00:30.127
We can defeat them.

7
00:00:30.128 --> 00:00:33.022
Brad: We have to do the same thing as before.

8
00:00:33.023 --> 00:00:35.661
Brad: Remember how we fixed the flower?

9
00:00:35.662 --> 00:00:37.637
Danny: You mean with powder?

10
00:00:37.638 --> 00:00:44.182
Brad: Exactly. Quick, make some more pepper shakers.

11
00:00:44.183 --> 00:00:46.590
Brad: Danny, you use your red one.

12
00:00:46.591 --> 00:00:48.225
I’ll take a yellow one.

13
00:00:48.226 --> 00:00:51.553
Brad: Tina, you take the other one.

14
00:00:51.554 --> 00:00:54.179
Tina: Okay, but what do we do with them?

15
00:00:54.180 --> 00:01:03.538
Brad: Sprinkle a whole bunch of powder onto your hand. You too, Bello.

16
00:01:03.539 --> 00:01:06.588
Bello: Colors!

17
00:01:06.589 --> 00:01:15.857
Brad: Now, blow a great big cloud of color!

18
00:01:15.858 --> 00:01:19.163
Bello: Clouds!

19
00:01:19.164 --> 00:01:20.484
Tina: Now what?

20
00:01:20.485 --> 00:01:22.569
Brad: We wait.

21
00:01:22.570 --> 00:01:25.206
Danny: Are you sure this is going to work?

22
00:01:25.207 --> 00:01:29.714
Brad: Well . . . I’m not a hundred percent sure.

23
00:01:29.715 --> 00:01:36.475
Tina: Oh great. Now you tell us!

24
00:01:36.476 --> 00:01:43.140
Danny: It’s making them sneeze!

25
00:01:43.141 --> 00:01:46.739
Tina: Look! They’re sneezing out different colors!

26
00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:49.946
Brad: It’s just like Danny’s rainbow-colored key.

27
00:01:49.947 --> 00:01:56.922
Brad: You make new colors by mixing together other colors.

28
00:01:56.923 --> 00:02:02.497
Tina: Look, red and yellow make orange.

29
00:02:02.498 --> 00:02:07.593
Danny: That one is sneezing brown.

30
00:02:07.594 --> 00:02:10.362
Brad: And that one is sneezing violet.

31
00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:12.717
Tina: And something else is happening!

32
00:02:12.718 --> 00:02:22.526
Brad: Tina’s right. They're shrinking.

33
00:02:22.527 --> 00:02:29.835
Danny: This is great!

34
00:02:29.836 --> 00:02:33.449
Danny: And look what else is happening!

35
00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:36.897
Brad: The color is coming back to Hopian’s garden.

36
00:02:36.898 --> 00:02:38.486
Bello: Pretty.

37
00:02:38.487 --> 00:02:48.105
Tina: Bello’s right. It is very pretty.

38
00:02:48.106 --> 00:02:51.014
Danny: Everything is turning green again.

39
00:02:51.015 --> 00:02:55.125
Tina: Of course. Blue and yellow make green.

40
00:02:55.126 --> 00:02:57.185
Brad: It must be the water.

41
00:02:57.186 --> 00:03:00.345
Brad: Plants get water from the soil through their roots.

42
00:03:00.346 --> 00:03:09.745
Brad: The water is spreading the color to all the plants in Ginormous!

43
00:03:09.746 --> 00:03:11.595
Tina: Nice kick, Bello!

44
00:03:11.596 --> 00:03:14.454
I wish you could be on my soccer team!

45
00:03:14.455 --> 00:03:16.153
Bello: Soccer!

46
00:03:16.154 --> 00:03:19.081
Brad: Colors do such amazing things!

47
00:03:19.082 --> 00:03:25.950
Danny: The four of us do some amazing things too!
